  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2√2x3 - 3√3y3 = (√2x - √3y)(Ax2 - Bxy + Cy2)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ - b³ = (a - b) (a² + ab + b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2√2x3 - 3√3y3 = (√2x - √3y) (Ax2 - Bxy + Cy2)\n\n⇒ (√2x)3 - (√3y)3 = (√2x - √3y) (Ax2 - Bxy + Cy2)\n\n⇒ (√2x - √3y) (2x2 + √6xy + 3y2) = (√2x - √3y) (Ax2 - Bxy + Cy2)\n\nSo, A = 2; B = -√6; and C = 3\n\nThen, (A2 + B2 + C2) = 22 + (√6)2 + 32\n\n= 4 + 6 + 9\n\n= 19\n\n∴ The value of (A2 + B2 + C2) is 19",
